# Unreal Engine 5 — .gitignore
# For: GLITCH//SHIFT: DON'T LOOK BACK by MysticCode

# ===== GENERATED / BINARY FILES (DO NOT TRACK) =====
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
Build/

# ===== IDE AND EDITOR TEMP FILES =====
.vs/
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.user
*.dbg

# ===== OS TEMP =====
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ===== MUST BE TRACKED (DO NOT IGNORE) =====
# .uproject          — project file
# Config/            — engine/game/input configuration
# Content/           — ALL game assets including .uasset files
# Plugins/           — custom plugins if any
# Scripts/           — editor automation scripts
# *.md               — documentation
# *.bat              — launcher scripts
# LaunchEditor*.bat  — editor launchers

# NOTE: .uasset files are Unreal Blueprint/Asset binary files
# They MUST be tracked in git for the game to work.
# Do NOT add *.uasset to this gitignore.
